## How It Works

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Initialize `dist[source] = 0`, all others `∞`. Push `(0, source)` into the min-heap. |
| 2 | Pop the node `u` with the smallest tentative distance. |
| 3 | **Stale check**: if the popped distance `d` is greater than `dist[u]`, skip (another path already found a shorter route). |
| 4 | **Relax** every neighbor `v` of `u`: if `dist[u] + w(u,v) < dist[v]`, update `dist[v]` and push

